# name: apple-private-relay-connections
# priority: 2030
# section: apple
# description: iCloud Private Relay（隐私中继）与 Apple DNS 别名
# boundary: 在 iCloud 同步前识别隐私中继；PCC 和系统 AI 扩展由 Apple Intelligence 规则处理，不包含整个 iCloud 或 Apple DNS 后缀
# created-at: 2026-11-19T10:51:17Z
# updated-at: 2026-11-19T10:51:17Z
# source: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/blackmatrix7/ios_rule_script/master/rule/Loon/iCloudPrivateRelay/iCloudPrivateRelay.list
# canonical-rule-count: 6
# rule-count: 6
# format: quantumult-x
# canonical: rules/2030-apple-private-relay-connections.lsr

host,mask-api.fe.apple-dns.net,proxy
host,mask-api.icloud.com,proxy
host,mask-t.apple-dns.net,proxy
host,mask.apple-dns.net,proxy
host-suffix,mask-h2.icloud.com,proxy
host-suffix,mask.icloud.com,proxy
